emana","given":{"lastFinished":{"dayNumber":5,"weekNumber":1},"numDays":5,"numWeeks":4},"expect":{"dayNumber":1,"weekNumber":2}},{"name":"periodizado en la ultima semana: la semana vuelve a 0","why":"Semana 3 de 4 (0-based) al rotar da (3+1) % 4 = 0.","given":{"lastFinished":{"dayNumber":5,"weekNumber":3},"numDays":5,"numWeeks":4},"expect":{"dayNumber":1,"weekNumber":0}},{"name":"numWeeks 0 con rotacion no explota","why":"Un doc con `numWeeks: 0` EXPLICITO esquiva el `?? 1` del fromJson generado, que solo cubre el campo ausente. Sin el guard, `% 0` tira IntegerDivisionByZeroException y mata el \'empezar en 1 tap\'.","given":{"lastFinished":{"dayNumber":5,"weekNumber":0},"numDays":5,"numWeeks":0},"expect":{"dayNumber":1,"weekNumber":0}},{"name":"numWeeks 0 sin rotacion deja la semana intacta","given":{"lastFinished":{"dayNumber":2,"weekNumber":0},"numDays":5,"numWeeks":0},"expect":{"dayNumber":3,"weekNumber":0}},{"name":"numWeeks negativo se trata como 1","why":"Un valor negativo no tira excepcion pero daria una semana fuera de rango.","given":{"lastFinished":{"dayNumber":3,"weekNumber":0},"numDays":3,"numWeeks":-2},"expect":{"dayNumber":1,"weekNumber":0}},{"name":"dayNumber corrupto mayor que numDays","why":"Un doc editado a mano puede tener dayNumber 7 en una rutina de 5 dias. (7 % 5) + 1 = 3, y 7 >= 5 cuenta como rotacion, asi que la semana avanza. Comportamiento raro pero DEFINIDO: se documenta para que Swift lo replique en vez de inventar el suyo.","given":{"lastFinished":{"dayNumber":7,"weekNumber":0},"numDays":5,"numWeeks":4},"expect":{"dayNumber":3,"weekNumber":1}}]}';

